  "body": "Found during the theme audit for #2039 (`upstream/main` `31f8d03d7`). Companion to #2025 (open PR #2038).\n\nWhat is fixed today:\n- **Operation tabs** (`crates/ui/src/egui_app/op_tabs.rs`): `ICON_PX = 12.0` (`:123`), `PAD_X = 6.0` (`:124`), top-only `CornerRadius { nw: 4, ne: 4, sw: 0, se: 0 }` (`:125`, ignores `pal.radius_widget`), `item_spacing.x = 1.0` (`:128`), `FontId::proportional(12.0)` (`:135`, ignores `pal.font_row` / theme font), icon-label gap `3.0` (`:137,162`), tab height `22.0` (`:138`), hover outline `Stroke::new(1.0, pal.accent_hover)` (`:143`), bottom rule `Stroke::new(2.0, pal.accent)` (`:174`), and trailing gap `ui.add_space(4.0)` (`:175`).\n- **Browser tree & row highlights**:\n  - `crates/ui/src/egui_app/painted.rs:241` (`TREE_INK = 16.0`), `:245` (`EYE_RESERVE = 24.0`), `:312-313` (eye center inset `12.0`, hit rect `18.0 x 16.0`), `:344` (depth indent `12.0 + row.depth as f32 * 16.0`), `:396-397` (non-eye reserve `6.0`, label offset `+ 12.0`), `:406` (header font boost `pal.font_row + 0.5`), `:413` (suffix gap `6.0`), `:122` (`MIN_LABEL_PX = 10.0` shrink floor).\n  - `crates/ui/src/egui_app/browser_pane.rs:33` (`Margin::symmetric(6, 2)`), `:253` (drag insertion rule `Stroke::new(2.0, pal.accent)`).\n  - `crates/ui/src/egui_app/geo_page.rs:186` (`rect_stroke(..., 2.0, Stroke::new(2.0, ink))` ignores `pal.radius_widget`).\n\nDone means:\n- Operation tab dimensions/font/radius, browser tree indent/glyph/eye reserve, and geometry selection highlight radius read theme tokens (`Tokens` + `pal.radius_widget` / `pal.font_row` or new tokens where distinct sizing is needed), with safe `clamp` bounds.\n- Once #2038 merges, `assets/themes/theme.json.example` includes every new key and its key-set test passes; default dark/light visuals remain unchanged unless edited in a theme.\n",
